{"route":"/docs/4.5/content/figures/","version":"4.5","renderedVersion":"4.5","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Figures","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.5.3/site/docs/4.5/content/figures.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for displaying related images and text with the figure component in Bootstrap."},{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Anytime you need to display a piece of content—like an image with an optional caption, consider using a <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code>."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the included <code>.figure</code> , <code>.figure-img</code> and <code>.figure-caption</code> classes to provide some baseline styles for the HTML5 <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code> elements. Images in figures have no explicit size, so be sure to add the <code>.img-fluid</code> class to your <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> to make it responsive."},{"id":"content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"babdae96c98be4af715b","height":147},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Aligning the figure’s caption is easy with our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/utilities/text/#text-alignment\">text utilities</a>."},{"id":"content--example-2","type":"demo","key":"16c3b364c5f1ca86337e","height":147},{"id":"content--code-2","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption text-right\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"babdae96c98be4af715b","html":"\n<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img figure-img img-fluid rounded\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 400x300\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">400x300</text></svg>\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"16c3b364c5f1ca86337e","html":"\n<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img figure-img img-fluid rounded\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 400x300\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">400x300</text></svg>\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption text-right\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"